---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Reviews policy" description="How customer reviews work on Calib.Tools.">
  <section class="container-x py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="prose-calib mx-auto max-w-[640px]">
      <h1 class="h-display m-0 text-[32px] leading-[1.08] md:text-[44px]">Reviews policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">How reviews work on Calib.Tools.</p>
      <ol class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        <li><strong class="text-ink">Order reviews</strong> are invited by e-mail after delivery. Each invitation is linked to a specific order and line item.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-ink">Shared reviews</strong> come from people who bought through another channel or evaluated samples. They are published with the reviewer's written permission. Any free sample, discount or company connection is stated on the review card.</li>
        <li>We publish every review we receive, positive or negative. We never offer anything in return for a favourable review. We do not edit review text. Reviews are never moved between products.</li>
        <li>We remove only spam, personal attacks, or content that contains personal data (addresses, phone numbers). When we remove a review, a visible note stating the reason replaces it.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-8 text-[15px] text-ink-muted">We do not pay for reviews, offer discounts in exchange for reviews, or use any other incentive.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-ink-muted">
        Questions? <a href="mailto:hello@calib.tools">hello@calib.tools</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
